    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enjoy 3 games!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is a competitive <u>board</u> game. Read the rules to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other is a cooperative game. Each player is assigned a keyboard <u>arrow key</u> and can only move in that direction. Work with your partner to advance through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a <u>slide</u> mode with special tiles and the goal is to avoid obstacles and reach the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Just Enjoy!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this competitive board game, bomb your friends' way cards and send emojis to cheer them on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try this challenging co-op game with your friends! It won't be easy! (very hard)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enjoy 3 games!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is a competitive <u>board</u> game. Read the rules to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other is a cooperative game. Each player is assigned a keyboard <u>arrow key</u> and can only move in that direction. Work with your partner to advance through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a <u>slide</u> mode with special tiles and the goal is to avoid obstacles and reach the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Just Enjoy!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this competitive board game, bomb your friends' way cards and send emojis to cheer them on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try this challenging co-op game with your friends! It won't be easy! (very hard)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
